`grounds with only section 3 no. 1 raised` MEANS `Facts bearing on the grounds for refusing access` OF `loud facts about section 3 no. 1`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 2`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 3`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 4, other than a statutory duty`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 5`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 6`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 7`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 8`, `quiet facts about section 4(1)`, `quiet facts about section 5`, `quiet facts about section 6`
`grounds with only section 3 no. 2 raised` MEANS `Facts bearing on the grounds for refusing access` OF `quiet facts about section 3 no. 1`, `loud facts about section 3 no. 2`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 3`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 4, other than a statutory duty`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 5`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 6`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 7`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 8`, `quiet facts about section 4(1)`, `quiet facts about section 5`, `quiet facts about section 6`
`grounds with only section 3 no. 3 raised` MEANS `Facts bearing on the grounds for refusing access` OF `quiet facts about section 3 no. 1`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 2`, `loud facts about section 3 no. 3`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 4, other than a statutory duty`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 5`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 6`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 7`, `quiet facts about section 3 no. 8`, `quiet facts about section 4(1)`, `quiet facts about section 5`, `quiet facts about section 6`
