        `data from service, office or mandate files` IS elem "data from service, office or mandate files" trues
        `personal data under a professional or official secret` IS elem "personal data under a professional or official secret" trues
        `only name, title and office contact details` IS elem "only name, title and office contact details" trues
        `the third party gave an expert opinion` IS elem "the third party gave an expert opinion" trues
